sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor NV as Thu ngân
    participant POS as POS Frontend
    participant API as sales-service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant KF as Kafka

    Note over NV,KF: Luồng bán hàng POS (Order-to-Cash)

    NV->>POS: Chọn SP, thanh toán
    POS->>API: POST /orders
    API->>DB: Kiểm phiên OPEN + tồn kho
    API->>DB: Ghi sale_record (order_created)
    API-->>POS: 201 Created

    POS->>API: POST /orders/{id}/approve
    API->>DB: Trừ tồn kho + order_approved
    API->>DB: Ghi outbox sale-approved
    API-->>POS: 200 OK

    POS->>API: POST /orders/{id}/mark-payment-done
    API->>DB: Ghi payment + payment_done
    API->>DB: Ghi outbox payment-captured
    API-->>POS: 200 OK
    POS-->>NV: Hoàn tất

    Note over API,KF: Bất đồng bộ (OutboxRelay)
    API->>KF: sale-approved → inventory-service
    API->>KF: payment-captured → finance-service
